/T (Your tracking/dancing robot is supposed to react differently depending on what the camera detects, but it keeps performing the same one action over and over. You notice that the variable storing the recognition value \(such as X or the recognition result\) always shows the same number. What would you investigate first, and what step-by-step actions would you take to find and fix the problem?)
